<title>USA: Nissan September US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Nissan September US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    37,449	    34,492	    +13.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  17,955	    19,226	     -2.7</p>
<p> Import Car		21,094	    21,223	     +3.5</p>
<p> Import Truck	     7,267	    10,126	    -25.2</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   255,061	   246,392	     +3.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 137,061	   144,164	     -5.3</p>
<p> Import Car	     151,671	   170,433	    -11.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	    50,649	    48,670	     +3.6</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
